Both files are emitted as complete replacements so application is idempotent regardless of the current corrupted on-disk state. I have not executed the suite — verify with `npx vitest run src/components/ui/button.test.jsx`. Note the third failure in the `[1/3]`/`[2/3]` sequence was truncated from the log you provided; if it originates outside these two files it will remain after this patch.